{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111752","id":2922666282,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6uNFkq","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111752","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111752.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111752.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111752","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111752/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111752/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111752/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7e9004099862e093e9ee60072fb0f1987168b32d","number":111752,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Core: Modernize C header with C++ equivalent (core/version.h)","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`core/version.h` would fail compiling with when compiled with MinGW with the C++ header. For the while being, it was left as is.\r\n<img width=\"808\" height=\"190\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/381bb6d5-7a74-4abe-a7fe-4231b7618b7e\" />\r\n\r\nWhile going through different files to see where I can help, I saw `core/version.h` & decided to update it with the following logic:\r\n```\r\n#if defined(_WIN32) && defined (__MINGW32__)\r\n#include <stdint.h>\r\n#else\r\n#include <cstdint>\r\n#endif\r\n``` \r\nThen, I compiled Godot for both MSVC & MinGW & the builds worked. You can check out the nightly builds at: https://github.com/AR-DEV-1/Godot-Nightly-Builds/releases\r\nThe basic purpose of this commit is to modernize the C header with C++ equivalent. I still have to see if I can just use `#include <cstdint>` overall.\r\nIf you want any changes, feel free to ping me.\r\nINFO: Actual error wasn't encountered by me, it was encountered by the maintainers. You can have a look at `core/version.h` for more information! The RC file includes `core/version.h`.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> Contributed by 2LazyDevs.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-10-17T01:51:41Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T08:21:31Z","closed_at":"2026-08-13T05:25:33Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":